  "job_C11.4_20251003_115135": {
    "chunk_text": "ealle weorc drihtnes drihtne heria\u00fe & oferblissia\u00fe hine on worlde Benedicite omnia opera Bletsia\u00fe englas drihtnes drihtne Benedicite angeli domini domino. Bletsia\u00fe heofonas drihtne benedicite caeli domino. Bletsia\u00fe w\u00e6teru ealle \u00fee ofer heofonas sind drihtne Benedicite aque omnes que super celo sunt Bletsia\u00fe ealle m\u00e6gen drihtnes drihtne benedicite omnes uirtutes domini domino. Bletsia\u00f0 sunne & mona drihtne Benedicite sol et luna domino. Bletsia\u00fe steorran heofonas drihtne Benedicite stelle caeli domino. Bletsia\u00fe ealle hagol & deaw drihtne Benedicite omnis ymber et ros domino. Bletsia\u00fe ealle gast god drihtne benedicite omnis spiritus dei domino. Bletsia\u00fe fir & swolo\u00f0 drihtne Benedicite ignis et estus domino. Bletsia\u00fe cile & swolo\u00fe drihtne benedicite frigus et estas domino. Bletsia\u00fe deawas & gicelgebland drihtne Benedicite rores et pruina domino. Bletsia\u00f0 forst & cile drihtne benedicite gelu et frigus domino. Bletsia\u00fe his & snaw drihtne Benedicite glacies et niues domino. Bletsia\u00f0 nihtes & d\u00e6ges drihtne benedicite noctes et dies domino. Bletsia\u00fe leoht & \u00feistru drihtne Benedicite lux et tenebre domino. Bletsia\u00f0 ligr\u00e6sces & genipu drihtne benedicite fulgora et nubes domino. Bletsia\u00fe eor\u00f0e drihten heria\u00fe & oferblissia\u00fe hine on worlde Benedicat terra dominum laudet et Bletsia\u00fe muntas & hillan drihtne Benedicite montes",
